# --- Poetry ---
# `poetry.lock` is INTENTIONALLY tracked for this project.
# This is a CLI application, not a library — every downstream
# install (pipx, pyinstaller, CI, dev environment) should resolve
# the exact same dependency graph that the maintainers tested.
# See https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/topics/repeatable-installs/
# for the library/lock guidance; for applications, the lock is
# the contract.
